# === Jupiter Fee Accounts (Platform Fee 50bps = 0.5%) ===
# These are Token Accounts (ATA), NOT wallet addresses
# Create ATAs for your fee wallet: spl-token create-account <MINT> --owner <FEE_WALLET>
VITE_JUPITER_FEE_ACCOUNT_WSOL=YOUR_WSOL_FEE_ACCOUNT_ATA
VITE_JUPITER_FEE_ACCOUNT_USDC=YOUR_USDC_FEE_ACCOUNT_ATA

# === Jupiter Referral Wallet (Optional - NOT used in current swap code) ===
